<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Mindfulness Meditation - Tellngrow</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-100 min-h-screen">
  {{> sidebar}}
  
  <nav class="bg-white shadow-md p-4">
    <div class="container mx-auto flex justify-between items-center">
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
        <button onclick="openSidebar()" class="text-gray-700 hover:text-purple-600 focus:outline-none">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"></path>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-purple-600">🌱 Tellngrow</h1>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <div class="container mx-auto p-6 max-w-4xl">
    <a href="/reading" class="inline-flex items-center text-purple-600 hover:text-purple-700 mb-6">
      <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"></path>
      </svg>
      Back to Reading Materials
    </a>

    <article class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8">
      <div class="mb-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="text-xs bg-green-100 text-green-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Wellness</span>
          <span class="text-sm text-gray-500">4 min read</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">🧘 Mindfulness Meditation</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600">Discover the benefits of mindfulness and how to practice it daily.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="h-64 bg-gradient-to-br from-green-500 to-teal-500 rounded-lg mb-8 flex items-center justify-center">
        <span class="text-8xl">🧘</span>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">What is Mindfulness?</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Mindfulness is the practice of being fully present and engaged in the current moment, aware of your thoughts and feelings without judgment. It's about observing what's happening right now, rather than dwelling on the past or worrying about the future.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">Benefits of Mindfulness Meditation</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2 mb-4">
          <li>Reduces stress and anxiety</li>
          <li>Improves focus and concentration</li>
          <li>Enhances emotional regulation</li>
          <li>Better sleep quality</li>
          <li>Increased self-awareness</li>
          <li>Improved relationships</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">How to Practice Mindfulness</h2>
        
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">1. Start Small</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Begin with just 5 minutes a day. Find a quiet space, sit comfortably, and focus on your breath. When your mind wanders, gently bring it back to your breathing.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">2. Body Scan Meditation</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Lie down and mentally scan your body from head to toe, noticing any sensations, tension, or discomfort without trying to change anything.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">3. Mindful Walking</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Take a slow walk and pay attention to each step, the feeling of your feet touching the ground, and the movement of your body.
        </p>

        <div class="bg-green-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 p-6 my-8">
          <p class="text-green-900 font-semibold mb-2">💡 Tip:</p>
          <p class="text-green-800">
            Consistency is key. Practice mindfulness at the same time each day to build a lasting habit.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
